Z||000000||COUNTIBLIS||01-31-2001||05:56 PM||||I was out on a country road and drove by this old car lot.  What do I see? An 85 gt in prestine condition.  I stop to look at it and the first thing I see on the windshield is 2695.00!!!!!!  Im like damn!  SO I go get the guy and ask him about and he said that he bought it at an auction. He said there is no battery hooked up becasue everytime its hooked up a small fire starts up.  Now he told me that he would sell me the car for 650.00 as is.  Would this be worth it?  <P><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/count3.gif"> ||||reg||1
